{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0377F0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"我小时候得过疟疾。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"很不巧，还是比较严重的疟疾。意识都变得朦胧，据说一度甚至被认为没救了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"疟疾性脑病。听说恶性疟疾很容易引发。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"直到现在，有时记忆还是会变得模糊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"从那以后我就怕蚊子……一听见蚊子振翅的声音，就会坐立不安。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"所以你才总是烟不离手吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"嗯。我想着多少能驱驱蚊。可能只是心理安慰。不过你不也一样吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"至少比起蚊子，我更喜欢雪茄。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"我也是。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"不过，你也很了不起。明明那么害怕蚊子，却还是作为游击队员奔波在山野间。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"别说了。El Che可是忍着哮喘之苦，让革命取得了成功。和他相比，我这根本不算什么。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""}]}